true,"passage_count_scope":"annotation_containers","explanation":"頻次依已驗同底本同位置去重；原始錨點完整保留，頻次不代表來源權威度。","included_kinds":["paragraph","table_cell"],"identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","ties":"all_maxima","frequency_is_not_authority":true},"kinship_interpretation_cases":[],"reported_variants":[],"family_tree_decisions":[],"preferred_relations":[],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[],"name_components":[{"person_id":"nbl_2bu_99w","title":null,"surname":"王","ming":"舒","additional_names":[],"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-073","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-073-yu-yi-bing-tiao","source_id":"s-jinshu-073-yu-yi-bing-tiao","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-073-yu-yi-bing-tiao:line094","quote":"會蘇峻作逆，遣兵攻冰，冰不能禦，便棄郡奔會稽。會稽內史王舒以冰行奮武將軍，距峻別率張健于吳中。時健党甚眾，諸將莫敢先進。冰率眾擊健走之，於是乘勝西進，赴於京都。又遣司馬滕含攻賊石頭城，拔之。冰勳為多，封新吳縣侯，固辭不受。遷給事黃門侍郎，又讓不拜。司空郗鑒請為長史，不就。出補振威將軍、會稽內史。徵為領軍將軍，又辭。尋入為中書監、揚州刺史、都督揚豫兗三州軍事、征虜將軍、假節。","note":"原文具名用稱分錄姓、名；不把官名、王號或字當本名，不改寫原字。","status":"editorial_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"model":null}],"mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-073-yu-yi-bing-tiao:line094:m0027","start":27,"end":29,"surface":"王舒","kind":"person","person_id":"nbl_2bu_99w","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-073-yu-yi-bing-tiao:line094","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-073-yu-yi-bing-tiao"},{"id":"c-jinshu-076-wangbin:line050:m0008","start":8,"end":10,"surface":"王舒","kind":"person","person_id":"nbl_2bu_99w","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-076-wangbin:line050","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-076-wangbin"},{"id":"c-jinshu-076-wangbin:line050:m0080","start":80,"end":82,"surface":"荊州","kind":"person","person_id":"nbl_2bu_99w","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-076-wangbin:line050","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-076-wangbin"},{"id":"c-jinshu-076-wangbin:line050:m0100","start":100,"end":101,"surface":"舒","kind":"person","person_id":"nbl_2bu_99w"